<title>GERMANY: Audi details 1996 profit, sales.</title>
<headline>Audi details 1996 profit, sales.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   302     vs 111</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     862     vs 589</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    1,496   vs 1,774</p>
<p>    Group investments			  1,445   vs 865</p>
<p>    Group sales				  18,807  vs 16,678</p>
<p>Group worldwide customer deliveries  492,046 vs 447,855</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>    -- Germany				   217,858 vs 204,138</p>
<p>    -- Western Europe			  199,013 vs 175,231</p>
<p>    -- United States			   27,379  vs 18,124</p>
<p>    -- Rest of World			   47,796  vs 50,362</p>
<p>    Group car production		     491,501 vs 446,808</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>    -- A3					  51,813  vs 51</p>
<p>    -- A4/80				     313,927 vs 289,727</p>
<p>    -- Carbriolet				8,337   vs 8,783</p>
<p>    -- A6/100				    106,326 vs 131,825</p>
<p>    -- A8					  11,098  vs 12,705</p>
<p>    -- Coupe				     0	 vs 3,717</p>
<p>    Group workforce (31.12.96)	     35,215  vs 32,995</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carmaker is Audi AG, a unit of Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
